 ['2009–2014','Earlier creative production','3D Artist / Animator / Compositor','Anifora Multimedia (2013–2014): animation for HadiHuda. E-One Studio / Quark Energy System (2009–2013): environments and animation, including Hoodwink. Les’ Copaque (2009): compositing, colour correction and quality checking for Upin & Ipin.']
